{"story":{"id":"story-3808b3c31a841452","title":{"zh":"解密密语","en":"Enigma Decoded"},"category":"society","image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","start":"first_contact.485","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"在冗长而困难的第一次接触流程后，我们的[Owner.GetLinguists]终于认出[This.ContactCountry.GetName]应该被称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。他们祝贺我们解开了他们的字谜，但看起来对我们花费如此长的时间颇有不满。最后的最后，我们的[Owner.GetLinguists]得以研发出数种新的模式辨识方法，让我们在未来可以更容易破译语言。","en":"After a long and arduous first contact process, our [Owner.GetLinguists] can now identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. They congratulate us for solving their linguistic riddles, although they seem a little put out"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.485"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.485","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.485","title":{"zh":"解密密语","en":"Enigma Decoded"},"texts":[{"zh":"在冗长而困难的第一次接触流程后，我们的[Owner.GetLinguists]终于认出[This.ContactCountry.GetName]应该被称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]。他们祝贺我们解开了他们的字谜，但看起来对我们花费如此长的时间颇有不满。最后的最后，我们的[Owner.GetLinguists]得以研发出数种新的模式辨识方法，让我们在未来可以更容易破译语言。","en":"After a long and arduous first contact process, our [Owner.GetLinguists] can now identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. They congratulate us for solving their linguistic riddles, although they seem a little put out with us that it took this long. At the very least, our [Owner.GetLinguists] were able to pioneer several new methods of pattern recognition which should stand us in good stead in the future."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"行。","en":"Phew."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-03b48b046e84a703"},{"target":"first_contact.1105","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"stor